rule link: LINK sorts a DLL's imports, all tied, and one element that sorts after them with msvcrt's qsort: twelve imports and that element are 13, so the partition swaps element 13/2 = 6, GetProcessHeap, to the front and pull element 0 takes its place
link /entry:main /subsystem:console /nodefaultlib kernel32.lib
imports=
  KERNEL32.dll GetProcessHeap
  KERNEL32.dll GetCurrentProcessId
  KERNEL32.dll GetCurrentThreadId
  KERNEL32.dll GetLastError
  KERNEL32.dll GetVersion
  KERNEL32.dll GetCommandLineA
  KERNEL32.dll GetTickCount
  KERNEL32.dll GetCurrentProcess
  KERNEL32.dll GetCurrentThread
  KERNEL32.dll GetACP
  KERNEL32.dll GetOEMCP
  KERNEL32.dll GetThreadLocale
